    "chunk_text": "Efter drihtnes \u00ferowunge and his \u00e6riste, \u00fe\u00e6t he of dea\u00f0e aras h\u00e6lend Crist: on \u00feam dagum his halgan Eac \u00fea gewear\u00f0 hit, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fea halga seagntes ofercomen \u00fea deofle, \u00fee wi\u00f0 heom gewunnon. And \u00fea ricene, \u00fee on \u00fean dagum w\u00e6ron, h\u00e6fdon heom geworht godes of golde and of seolfre; \u00fea w\u00e6ron Sum land is Anthiochia gehaten. On \u00feam lande w\u00e6s an godes \u00feeowa; se w\u00e6s Theothimus gehaten; he w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e gel\u00e6red man. And \u00fe\u00e6r on lande w\u00e6s sum h\u00e6\u00feen cyningc, Theodosius gehaten, and his cwen mid him. Hit gewear\u00f0 swa, \u00fe\u00e6t heo bearn gestreonedon and \u00fe\u00e6t wear\u00f0 geboren m\u00e6dencild. And se h\u00e6\u00feene cing his f\u00e6der hit het ut aweorpan and men swa dyde. And se godes \u00feeowe Theothimus gefand \u00fe\u00e6t cild and he hit up anam and hit wel bef\u00e6ste to fedenne. And \u00fea hit andgeat h\u00e6fde, he him nama gesette, and \u00fe\u00e6t w\u00e6s Margareta, and hi sy\u00f0\u00f0an to lare bef\u00e6ste, \u00d0is eadiga m\u00e6den se arwur\u00f0a godes \u00feeowa Theothimus fedde and l\u00e6rde and for\u00f0brohte, o\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t hi XV D\u00e6ghwamlice hi hire utsanges and hire gebedu georne gefylde and \u00fe\u00e6t ungel\u00e6rde folc swi\u00f0e Forwyrpa\u00f0 \u00fea deadan godas, \u00fee ge her beforen to gebugan, \u00fee beo\u00f0 mid mannes handen gegrafena, and And ic eow behata and on hand selle, \u00fe\u00e6t ge sculon finden reste eowre sawlen mid gode and mid his Seo eadiga",
